Day -3 (git instructions continuation )
        
        -> git init                             /*initilizes the git for the local folder
        -> git add .                            /*creates the mode for the files which are resented int he local folder
        -> git commit -m "Initial commit"       /*sends a comment to git for user knowledge
        -> git branch -M main                   /*makes the branch master to the main
        -> git remote add origin https://github.com/your-username/your-repo-name.git /*and this send the location to store the local files into the git repo
        -> git push -u origin main              /*finally it pushes the local files tot eh repo 
        -> git status                           /*it displats the status if the files are up to date are not

